WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:37.190
We are now conducting an investigation into the attempt on the life of her Royal Majesty,

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:38.590
Queen Orgeld of Lastonia.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:41.060
But I know nothing!

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:48.720
My mother once pleaded her own innocence in the same way, yet no-one listened to her.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:54.540
Now, speak! You plotted to kill me and succeed to the throne, didn't you?!

00:01:54.540 --> 00:02:00.090
No! I'm shocked that my grandfather and my mother would even have anything to do...

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.880
with such a sordid affair!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.670
Please believe me. Have mercy!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.280
Mercy?!

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:14.020
No-one showed <i>me</i> mercy when I was locked away in these dungeons!

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:18.550
Please believe me when I tell you that I love you!

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:22.490
Please show my grandfather and my mother mercy...

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.280
They were both executed at dawn.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.680
Gottfried, guilty
of high treason.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.680
Queen Ragnid,
guilty of high treason.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.420
Have mercy!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:42.840
Episode 38 - The Two Princesses: Act Two

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:47.910
Was Princess Aldis really ignorant of the plot or...

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:52.140
She knew nothing. That's the only answer.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.840
She's an unsuspecting angel!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:04.190
But you, Minister Guriel, know too much.

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:15.130
You may have slain me, Princess Orgeld, but you will never be safe.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.600
Just as you have wrested the throne, someone may wrest it from your own grasp.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.060
Kill him!

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:28.480
Just as I have...

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:32.150
I want the number of guards at the dungeon doubled!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:36.780
No-one shall enter the dungeons without my express consent!

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:41.710
Aldis will stay down there forever!

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:44.170
God is always with you.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:47.360
It is dangerous to keep Princess Aldis where she is!

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.900
Put her to death!

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:49.760
No.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:51.430
Put her on trial and execute her!

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.220
No!

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:54.060
Kill Princess Aldis!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.790
I can't kill her!

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:02.050
If I kill her and then die soon after, Lastonia will fall into the hands of Erinwald!

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.880
My life would be in danger.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:09.070
That girl is my trump card.

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:14.280
You must never forget that God will always walk with you.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:17.090
God is with me.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.390
I can no longer trust anyone.

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:24.150
If I let my guard down, I'll surely be slain.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:29.880
By my husband. By the servants. They're all against me.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:41.190
<i>Orgeld... Trust no-one. Love no-one.</i>

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:41.200
Who are you? Who's there?!

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.340
If you don't want to become like us, you must watch your back.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.560
Father!

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:49.430
You betrayed me, even though I trusted in you!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.150
Baron Bjornson!

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.570
Queen Ragnid!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.110
Count Gottfried!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:05:02.430
Well done. Your scheming has destroyed our house and our kingdom!

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:03.810
King Harland!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:08.270
You're next. Just as you have once done to others.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.530
Stop it!

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:13.490
It looked like you were dreaming.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:14.880
Grandmother!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:18.820
I have come to warn you.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:25.340
Orgeld, are you prepared to live in hell?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.170
What do you mean?

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:32.460
Living in this country as Queen is the same as living in hell!

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:39.290
Empress Dowager - no, Grandmother - why am I living in hell?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:43.060
For me, the days I spent in the dungeons were the embodiment of hell.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.520
Those hard, sad and lonely days.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.840
Lonely?

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:53.350
And what are your days now if they are not lonely?

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:05.340
I trust no-one. I love no-one.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:10.170
And no-one trusts me, nor loves me.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.640
I live in hell!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:20.730
I hear you don't want to kill Aldis, the maiden of the white prison.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.060
Sir Acio!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:29.170
It is most unfortunate. If you die, then Aldis succeeds to the throne.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:34.040
It means I don't even need you to take your throne away from you.

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:40.200
He means to kill me and marry Aldis!

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:43.310
I will not allow that to happen!

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:47.160
Let Aldis become Queen?

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:53.300
She must have spent the last three years in the dungeon crying her eyes out at her hardship,

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.680
her despair and her bitterness.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:07:00.670
I'm certain she has become as consumed by hate as I once was!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.500
I want to see her face!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.150
Laughter?!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.590
Impossible!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.640
She looks the same as she did when I first met her: her smile is that of the Spring Goddess!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:21.250
So, nothing has changed in the last three years, Aldis?

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.050
My sister, Orgeld!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.120
Our sincerest apologies, Princess Orgeld!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.460
Please don't punish them!

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:41.770
They try to cheer me up when I get lonely.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.550
Even the guards are kind to you...

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:48.040
All I ever got from them was abuse.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:53.070
How can we be so different when we're both princesses?

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.640
Elder sister!

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:57.330
This prison hasn't changed at all.

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:02.420
In the eight years I spent down here, I didn't laugh once!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:06.410
So, how can you smile so?

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:09.260
You smile like a cheerful little cherub.

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:13.130
At first, I was shocked by the harshness of this place,

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:19.570
but then I realized for the first time how privileged my life had been in the palace.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:25.330
I couldn't believe that basking in the sunlight could feel so good...

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:30.150
or having people smile at me could feel so wonderful!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:34.080
Why don't you hate the people who put you here?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:38.140
Why don't you hate me for locking you away?!

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:43.770
Stop deceiving me and tell me how you really feel!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.540
Princess Orgeld!

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.190
Go ahead. Pick it up, Aldis!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.770
If you kill me, you shall become Queen!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.070
How can you say such a thing?!

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:02.110
Either kill me or I will kill you.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.260
I'm being completely serious.

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.730
This is my reason for coming down here.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.540
Why would you want to kill the Princess?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:15.520
Your very existence threatens me, Aldis.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:20.190
I can never guess when the restless people...

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:24.790
or the power-hungry vassals will rise up to support you and aim their swords towards me instead!

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:32.080
But, you have the country of Erinwald behind you. No-one would dare rise up against you!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:37.080
And what if that country attacks me?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.560
Elder sister!

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:42.620
If I die, you will become Queen.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.000
You could escape this place and return to the palace.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:50.070
If you think I should die, then go ahead. Take this blade from my hands!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.050
Move aside, Vienna!

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:56.040
No! Even if you order me as my Queen, I will not move!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.250
Princess!

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:04.600
Vienna!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.520
How pathetic. She's fainted.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.640
Aldis.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:17.960
I see you are finally showing your true face.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:21.630
Don't come near me, sister.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:24.030
Why do you say such things?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:28.820
I haven't forgotten the days when you were kind to me.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:31.130
Me... kind?!

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:36.500
Wasn't it you who went to Erinwald in my stead?

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.330
You did that because you loved me.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:44.070
You think I love you?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:50.850
I don't love you. I hate you more than anyone!

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:51.970
Sister!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:56.910
How pitiable I was, sitting in this icy dungeon, constantly reminded of my mother every time...

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:59.210
I heard whispers of your happiness!

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.450
Each day passed in despair.

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:08.690
I cursed the world and hated mankind.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:14.000
I needed power to avenge my poor mother's death!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:22.200
I would gladly walk boldly across to our enemies, if it meant I could escape this hellhole.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:25.990
Shall I tell you something even more delightful?

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:33.020
I am the one who saw to the King's slow and painful death. I poisoned him.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.290
I don't believe you.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.890
To your mother and her father, Count Gottfried,

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:42.260
I was an obstacle as the next in line to the throne.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:46.600
If they couldn't put you on the throne, they would lose all their control.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.070
So they hatched a plot to assassinate me...

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:53.010
without realizing that I had already planted spies.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:58.490
I was the person who murdered your family by having them executed.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:04.330
I was the person who had you locked in here and crushed your happiness!

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:09.630
You killed my father and had my mother and uncle executed!

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:13.780
So, you were just using my love and my trust?!

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:23.100
If you kill me, Aldis,

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:28.070
a new Queen shall be born!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:33.550
And if you kill me, you'll have one less person in your way.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:41.790
You'll also lose your last blood tie, your sister: the only person who loves you still.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:47.070
The only person who loved and trusted you.

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:51.680
If that is what it means to be Queen, then I do not wish to become one!

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:55.900
Looking at you, dear sister, it seems as though you haven't even a shred of happiness!

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.850
Silence, Aldis!

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:59.070
No!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:02.480
You are the most pitiable person in the world!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.430
A sad, lonely Queen!

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.100
Silence!

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:10.440
A sword can be used two ways.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:14.300
For self-defense or to kill your enemy.

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.980
Which would you like me to use?

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:23.480
You don't understand that this world is hell.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.080
Even if you trust someone, they will always betray you.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.160
Even if you love someone, they will use you.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.290
You must kill or be killed.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.830
You must deceive or be deceived!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.810
I've never known a single day of happiness.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:43.890
How can someone like you, who has been loved her whole life, ever understand that, Aldis?!

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:48.800
I hate you, Aldis.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.410
I hate you.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:57.850
Elder sister,

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.330
I return this to you.

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:05.470
I've realized that it has another use.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:10.000
If my existence causes you so much pain, then please...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:14.700
send me the same way as my mother and father.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:21.220
This is the only thing I can offer you.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.300
Aldis...

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:40.600
Why? Why will you not hate me?!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:45.800
Why must I, a Queen, feel defeated by you?!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:46.920
Elder sister!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.940
You must deceive or be deceived!

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.590
Please, Aldis!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.670
Don't uncover my unhappiness!

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:01.680
Don't uncover my love!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:07.310
I will live my entire life in hell like this!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:15.470
Spectacular, Ayumi. You truly are the heroine of this play.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:19.270
The Princess of Darkness, Orgeld, goes up against the Princess of Light, Aldis.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.550
Look, the light is being destroyed by the shadow!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.260
Ms. Tsukikage!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:27.750
It doesn't matter how dark the shadows are.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.300
There can be no shadow without light.

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:34.200
We are all God's children.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:38.730
May God watch over you.

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.910
An infiltrator! Don't let him escape!

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.870
Jurgis?

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:53.430
I heard that your life was in danger.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.360
Your Majesty?

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:57.250
Wait, Jurgis.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.670
Get him! He's over there!

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.740
Farewell, Aldis.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:10.600
What's happening?

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:13.170
Someone has infiltrated the dungeon!

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:16.830
Assemble the guards and escort me back to the castle!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.270
Yes, Your Majesty!

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.250
She let you escape.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.180
Princess, let's run.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:31.260
The fact that she has turned the other cheek means she is telling you to live.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.800
She's telling me to live?

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:39.720
Aldis has escaped.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:43.470
There's no use looking for her.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:48.190
Aldis, you are a Princess of Lastonia!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.650
We've crossed the border.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.110
We're safe now.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:58.670
Coming out of the dungeon, I am now happiest to see your face.

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:01.130
Will you stay with me then?

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:04.800
Yes, I will be your wife!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:11.170
No matter how far away I am to Lastonia, I will always be her Princess.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:15.150
I'll be watching you from afar, Orgeld, my sister.

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:19.040
So that this country does not shiver too much in the cold,

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:22.220
and so that the spring days may last longer.

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:24.530
Then, let's go!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:30.800
Lastonia is ruled by the Winter Emperor.

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:35.130
Cold... Aldis, I'm cold.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:39.630
My heart remains in winter... I cannot dredge it up out of the blizzard.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.510
Aldis!

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.650
Parliament is now in session!

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:46.980
Please, our Queen!

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:51.400
To avoid the arrows of ice, one must wear armor of snow.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:56.890
I don't need anyone to love. I'll spend my days in hell!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:04.050
Presenting Her Royal Majesty!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.010
You're up, Maya!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.270
What a strange feeling.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:35.800
It's as though I was controlled by another personality while I was on stage.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.710
I was living the life of a princess.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:06.090
An ocean of light that augments the shape of shadows...

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:10.550
You've found yourself a truly extravagant mask.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.370
<i>The Two Princesses</i>

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.390
That was quite the transformation.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:22.550
I can't believe this little girl turned into such a beautiful Aldis on stage.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.870
Thank you for the invitation.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:28.860
Thank you for coming.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.720
Your Aldis was good.

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:33.100
Better than I expected.

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:37.210
I will send you flowers as promised.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:40.010
Masumi Hayami is going to send Maya Kitajima flowers!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:44.690
You know, Masumi Hayami usually only sends flowers to superstars!

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:47.480
This is going to be great publicity!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.220
He's sending me flowers to get me some publicity?

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.010
Every night's sold out?

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:56.120
Yes.

00:19:56.120 --> 00:20:00.310
Everyone agrees unanimously that Ayumi Himekawa is spectacular.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:04.350
Then, the role of the Scarlet Angel will surely go to Ayumi Himekawa?

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:10.240
But, Maya Kitajima gives a very natural performance on stage too.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.540
Hers is no ordinary talent.

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:16.330
There's no doubt that this show has opened doors for her.

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:21.510
All she has to do is somehow receive an award for Best Actress.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:25.210
If she doesn't manage that, the Scarlet Angel will automatically go to Ayumi Himekawa.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:28.170
What did you say she said again?

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:34.100
That even if she only had a one percent chance at success, she would take that one percent.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.980
Not surprising, coming from a girl handpicked by Chigusa Tsukikage herself.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:42.790
By the way, Masumi, has anyone caught your eye lately?

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:46.400
Is this another attempt to marry me off, Father?

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.390
I'm not...

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.720
Just look at her picture.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:57.100
It's hard to believe how different this space looked just a short while ago.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:03.250
I've realized though that I still can't compete with you.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:04.940
I'd like to catch up soon!

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:10.020
Thank you. I'm sad that this play has come to an end.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:13.680
I feel like I'm losing part of myself.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:19.610
This was the first time I completely transformed into someone else.

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:20.880
Well...

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:21.990
What?

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:25.080
I guess I don't know much about that...

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:28.120
I mean, I always thought that...

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:32.790
being on stage automatically meant that you transformed into someone else.

00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:36.720
"To: Mr. Purple Roses."

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:37.840
"With all my gratitude."

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:42.330
She bought this straight after receiving her wage packet.

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:49.210
Maya, what would happen if you found out who I really was?

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:26.140
Hayami has a marriage proposal? I don't believe it!

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:32.790
What's this? It feels like a hole has opened up in my heart.

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:36.530
Why? He's the man who killed my mother!

00:23:37.110 --> 00:23:40.130
But sometimes, I feel so very confused.

00:23:40.130 --> 00:23:44.500
I feel like his eyes soften when he looks at me. Why is that?

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:48.670
I want to know his true feelings for me.

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 39 - The Purple Shadow
